  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"margin-top:10px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">各位老师、同学：</span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:32.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">根据</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\">清华大学</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">校历安排，2026年暑假</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\">时间为</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">月6日</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Batang\",serif\">~</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">月11日。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:black\">为保障暑假期间研究生教育教</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">学管理服务工作正常运行，研究生院安排老师于社会工作日在岗值班，值班时间为8:30</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Batang\",serif\">~</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">12:00</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">、13:30</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Batang\",serif\">~</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">17:00</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，详见下表。</span></span></span></span></p> \n <p sty